msgctxt "#31361"
msgid "While a video plays, the player controls close by themselves once no key was pressed for the time set below. While paused they stay; the time starts again when playback goes on."
msgstr "影片播放時，若在下方設定的時間內沒有按鍵，播放器控制列會自動關閉。暫停時會保留；繼續播放時重新計時。"

msgctxt "#31362"
msgid "Hide after"
msgstr "隱藏時間"

msgctxt "#31363"
msgid "Time without a key press before the player controls close, 3 to 30 seconds. OK takes the slider, left and right move it, OK lets go."
msgstr "播放器控制列關閉前無按鍵的時間，3 到 30 秒。按 OK 抓住滑桿，左右移動，再按 OK 放開。"

msgctxt "#31364"
msgid "The video player: its controls and what it shows while they are up."
msgstr "影片播放器：控制列，以及控制列開啟時顯示的內容。"

msgctxt "#31365"
msgid "Show the plot"
msgstr "顯示劇情"

msgctxt "#31366"
msgid "The plot of what plays, under its title while the player controls or the seek line are up."
msgstr "在播放器控制列或進度列開啟時，於標題下方顯示正在播放內容的劇情。"

